    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "can you break it down a bit more specifically? like if i'm starting from shinjuku in tokyo, does the train actually save time when you factor in getting to the airport vs just heading to the station? also any tips on avoiding delays or weird scheduling issues with the trains? i really cant afford to be late for my meetings.",
