      "content": "Traveling from Shinjuku to Tokyo Station for the Shinkansen is very quick via local trains, easily beating the time needed to get to a major airport like Narita or Haneda. To minimize delays, book reserved seats whenever possible, and check the Japan Rail Pass information for any regional restrictions on your specific routes. Always allow a buffer of at least 30 minutes between connections, just in case of unexpected operational changes.",
      "source": "target",
