    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks. one more thing, i've heard some people say that the rail system can be super unpredictable during certain times or even with certain types of service glitches. is there anything i should look out for that might cause a sudden disruption or just make the whole trip feel... chaotic? i'm just trying to be prepared for anything that might throw me off.",
