      "content": "The primary disruptions to watch out for are during peak evening rush hours (around 5 PM to 8 PM) when crowding is highest, though this doesn't always mean outright failure. Be aware of scheduled maintenance announcements, especially for express lines, which are usually posted online well in advance. Finally, if a major service warning is issued, using the official JR West or JR Central apps will provide the most immediate and accurate updates on delays.",
      "source": "target",
